\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil's real hits 2-week low on China, Europe\b0\par\par\uc2 584 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 November 2010\par 14:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 (Repeats to additional subscribers)\par \par \uc2 * Traders nervous ahead of G20 meeting in South Korea\par \par \uc2 * Brazil's real weakens 0.7 pct, Chile's peso down 0.9 pct\par \par \uc2 * Mexican peso gains 0.5 pct after strong U.S. jobs data (Adds details on Mexican and Peruvian bonds, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Caroline Stauffer\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/MEXICO CITY, Nov 10 (Reuters) - The Brazilian real and the Chilean peso fell sharply on Wednesday as investors grew concerned about euro-zone debt and slowing Chinese demand for Latin American exports.\par \par \uc2 China, Brazil's top trading partner, ordered its banks to put more money in reserve in an effort to put the brakes on its economy, which China worries may be overheating. For more see [ID:nSGE6A9091].\par \par \uc2 Weak Chinese import data added to fears that the Asian giant is not buying as many of Latin America's exports, such as soybeans and iron ore, as it has in previous months.\par \par \uc2 Fresh concerns about euro zone debt also came back to haunt the market, prompting investors to ditch higher-risk assets. [ID:nLDE6A924J]\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real <BRBY> dropped 0.71 percent to 1.709 reais per U.S. dollar on the local spot market, closing at its weakest level in about two weeks.\par \par \uc2 Investors were also cautious ahead of this week's Group of 20 rich and developing nations summit in South Korea, which is to tackle growing tensions over \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  imbalances.\par \par \uc2 "We're in a very difficult situation. If there is no coordination this time, there is a risk that everyone will go their own way, taking their own measures," said Raphael Martello, an economist at Tendencias consultancy in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 That could mean more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures in \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has been struggling to contain a rise in the real.\par \par \uc2 Further tax increases on foreign purchases of local bonds or a reinstatement of income tax for foreigners on those bonds are the most likely options, said Martello.\par \par \uc2 MEXICAN PESO OUTPERFORMS\par \par \uc2 The Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <MXN=> gained 0.52 percent to 12.2365 per dollar after a U.S. government report showed jobless claims fell more than expected in the latest week.\par \par \uc2 Mexico is less reliant on the commodity trade with China, exporting mainly to the United States.\par \par \uc2 "The peso is reacting favorably to the jobs data," said Antonio Magana, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Interacciones brokerage in Mexico City. "I think investors will move to sell dollars now that the peso is looking to break the 12.2000 level."\par \par \uc2 The peso pared some gains after a sale of U.S. 30-year Treasury bonds was met with the weakest demand in a year. [ID:nN10194812]\par \par \uc2 That sale also pushed down the price of Mexican debt, causing a 10 basis-point spike in the yield on Mexico's benchmark 10-year bond <MX10YT=RR>.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, Peru took advantage of growing demand for emerging market debt, selling $2.5 billion in two bonds maturing in 10 and 40 years. [ID:nN10204173]\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=> weakened 0.85 percent to 481.1 per dollar as the price of copper, the country's main export, fell sharply.\par \par \uc2 Two \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  polls from the Andean country on Wednesday showed the market expects Chile's peso to appreciate to 475 per dollar by next week but settle at 480 in January. [ID:nN10158242] (Editing by Dan Grebler)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|E|RBN|M|D|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101113e6ba000ah\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
