\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil's real barely budges after tax hike\b0\par\par\uc2 552 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 2010\par 01:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Brazil real flat in world market, holds key level\par \par \uc2 * Strong US dollar hits region, Mexican peso falls 0.6 pct\par \par \uc2 * Chile's peso slumps 1.1 pct after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threats\par \par \uc2 (Recasts to include increase to \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tax on bonds)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Caroline Stauffer\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/MEXICO CITY, Oct 4 (Reuters) - Brazil's real showed a muted reaction on Monday to the government's decision to double its tax on foreign investment in the country's bonds.\par \par \uc2 Analysts were largely sceptical about the effectiveness of the measure, which the government hopes will slow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent rally by discouraging short-term investment.\par \par \uc2 Although the real dipped after the announcement, it still held above the key 1.70 threshold, which analysts believe is the authorities' unofficial comfort level.\par \par \uc2 And after two hours, the real had pared its losses and was flat at 1.6975, according to the international reference rate. But the local market <BRBY>, where most of the action takes place due to the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  controls, had already closed before the announcement.\par \par \uc2 The government said it would raise the so-called IOF tax on Brazilian bonds to 4.0 percent but leave the existing tax on foreign purchases of Brazilian stocks at 2.0 percent. [ID:nN04132890]\par \par \uc2 The move is designed to discourage investors from borrowing cheaply abroad and making the most of Brazil's high interest rates, via the so-called carry trade.\par \par \uc2 "The impact of this measure is going to be short-lived and won't be significant. The government is trying to stop a tsunami," said Ricardo Amorim, president of Ricam Consultoria, a Sao Paulo-based consulting firm.\par \par \uc2 Analysts had been divided over whether the government would take action following Sunday's presidential election, with some predicting that new measures were unlikely until after a runoff on Oct. 31.\par \par \uc2 ELECTION: WHAT ELECTION?\par \par \uc2 But aside from the debate over the inflows tax, the reaction to Brazil's election has been relatively muted. Neither of the top two candidates are expected to drastically alter current policies, making the election a "non-event" on trading floors.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian dollar-denominated bond due in 2040 <BRAGLB40=RR> lingered around its previous closing level for most of the day.\par \par \uc2 The yield on the interest-rate futures contract due in Jan. 2012 <DIJF2> fell one basis points to 11.44 percent.\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere across Latin America, concerns about the stability of the euro zone on Monday made the dollar's safe-haven status more attractive, causing it to strengthen against the region's other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mexico's peso <MXN=><MEX01> weakened 0.56 percent to 12.61.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso <CLP=CL>, which was also under pressure from further \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  threats, plunged 1.13 percent to 486.30.\par \par \uc2 Chilean President Sebastian Pinera said that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should do more to tame the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's recent rally. The peso has strengthened more than 12 percent since July due to the country's rapid recovery from a devastating earthquake in February.\par \par \uc2 Asked if the bank should do more to control the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Pinera said: "It can always do more." [ID:nN04108417] (Additional reporting by Isabel Versiani)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 3)|LANGWN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101007e6a4001pe\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
