\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil real edges higher as peso rallies\b0\par\par\uc2 785 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 September 2010\par 17:15\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited    \par \par \uc2 * Brazil real adds 0.1 pct, hurt by threat of inflows tax\par \par \uc2 * Mexico peso hits 14-week high after U.S. data\par \par \uc2 * Chile peso clings to 2-year high as c.bank concerns fade (Adds comments about Brazil's real, updates prices)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Froilan Romero\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/SANTIAGO, Sept 28 (Reuters) - Brazil's real edged higher on Tuesday, trailing the Mexican peso's sharp gains, as investors grew concerned about government attempts to manipulate the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real <BRBY> was bid 0.12 percent stronger at 1.706 reais per U.S. dollar on the local spot market, climbing higher after early losses. Meanwhile, the Mexican peso hit its strongest in over three months thanks to the weak dollar and some strong U.S. housing data.\par \par \uc2 "There is some profit-taking in global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. But it (the real's depreciation) is more to do with local factors, fears about measures which the government could take," said Roberto Padovani, chief Brazil economist with WestLB bank in Sao Paulo.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's real has rallied over 5.0 percent since the end of June, partly due to massive investment in last week's record share offering by national oil company \uc2 Petrobras\uc2 . That rally has put a huge pressure on exporters, whose goods are now more expensive and so harder to sell abroad.\par \par \uc2 The country's authorities have responded by buying even more dollars in the spot market and threatening a range of other measures, including \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the futures market via so-called 'reverse swaps'.\par \par \uc2 Imposing further taxes on capital inflows to restrain the rise of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also remains an "open possibility" for Brazil, the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said on Tuesday. [ID:nLDE68R0AT]\par \par \uc2 Brazil's government has also been blaming the real's rally on efforts by the United States to keep their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weak, at the expense of developing countries such as Brazil. [ID:nN27256208]\par \par \uc2 And on Monday, Brazilian Finance Minister \uc2 Guido Mantega\uc2  sparked debate across the world when he said various government's attempts to manipulate their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  equated to an "international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war". While economists have been making this point for weeks, it was the strongest comments to date by a senior government official.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a country's stock price," said Wolfgang Koester, chief executive of FIREapps, a provider of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedging software in Scottsdale, Arizona. "And there is massive unpredictability when so many companies are fighting to drive that share price down, rather than support it."\par \par \uc2 FLIP SIDE OF THE COIN\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar <.DXY> fell to its weakest level since February against a basket of the world's major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 Those losses gave support to Latin America's other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , initially boosting the Chilean peso <CLP=> to a fresh 27-month high.\par \par \uc2 But profit-taking caused the peso to later trade flat at 485.30, but still at its highest level since June 2008.\par \par \uc2 Traders said they had been bidding up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  because they were less worried about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The dollar has kept depreciating against leading \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the local authorities have made clear that it's still not the moment to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. So the path is cleared for the peso to keep appreciating," said one trader in Santiago.\par \par \uc2 While \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's authorities have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively in the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Chile has been reluctant to interfere with the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Instead, Chile has raised interest rates at a slower pace than it otherwise might have done, in an effort to tame the peso's appreciation. [ID:nN24245807]\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  analyst Alberto Ramos now expects the Chilean \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow its rate hikes at some point this year from 50 basis points to 25 basis points, possibly as early as October's meeting.\par \par \uc2 The Mexican peso <MXN=> strengthened 0.7 percent to 12.5000 per dollar, hitting its strongest level since June 21.\par \par \uc2 Due to Mexico's close trade ties with the United States, the peso has also benefited from improving U.S. economic data.\par \par \uc2 Tuesday's data on single-family home prices in the United States was better than expected, prompting the peso to extend its early gains. The report restored some confidence about the pace of the economic recovery in the United States and its future demand for Mexican exports. [ID:nN28171424]\par \par \uc2 The peso has also been boosted by expectations of investment ahead of the country's inclusion in October in a major global bond index, the WGBI, run by \uc2 Citigroup\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Brad Haynes in Santiago)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101001e69s001mw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
