\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-International  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  war among govts -Brazil finmin\b0\par\par\uc2 201 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2010\par 15:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Mantega says international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war on\par \par \uc2 * Strength of Brazil's real hurting exporters\par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepping up \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 (Adds quote, context)\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Reuters) - The world is now in an "international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war" as governments around the world try to weaken their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to boost their competitiveness, said Guido Mantega, Brazil's finance minister, at an event in Sao Paulo Monday.\par \par \uc2 "We're in the midst of an international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war, a general weakening of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This threatens us because it takes away our competitiveness," Mantega said.\par \par \uc2 The strength of Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real, has become a nagging concern for the government, with exporters hurt as their products become more expensive, and thus harder to sell, abroad.\par \par \uc2 The country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has stepped up its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market recently, holding two daily auctions to soak up dollars flooding into Brazil, where a booming economy has drawn global investors.\par \par \uc2 Other countries around the world have expressed similar concerns about their own \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Aluisio Alves; Writing by Luciana Lopez; Editing by Theodore d'Afflisio)\par \par \uc2 BRAZIL-ECONOMY/\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100930e69r00167\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
