\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's Real Gains As Market Awaits  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Alastair Stewart   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 September 2010\par 21:49\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real gained against the dollar Thursday as investors reassessed the Brazilian government's pledge to step into the market at any moment to slow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gains.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real closed at 1.7185 to the dollar on the BM&FBovespa exchange in Sao Paulo, compared with BRL1.7258 at Wednesday's close.\par \par \uc2 Finance Minister \uc2 Guido Mantega\uc2  has stressed in recent days that the government has the firepower to be able to absorb the flood of dollars coming into the local market, largely due to heavy overseas bond issuance by Brazilian companies and a coming huge share issue by oil giant \uc2 Petroleo Brasileiro SA\uc2  (PBR), or \uc2 Petrobras\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 However, investors started to pay more attention Wednesday when Mantega said the government would do what is necessary to stop appreciation after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Japanese government.\par \par \uc2 Thursday saw a slight adjustment in the real, but investors are holding tight, waiting for the government's first move.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought dollars at two auctions Thursday, as it has done since Sept. 8, to try to limit the real's gains. Meanwhile, Mantega once again raised the possibility that the government could use the sovereign wealth fund to soak up excess dollars on the local market.\par \par \uc2 -By Alastair Stewart, Dow Jones Newswires; 5511 3544-7072; alastair.stewart@dowjones.com [ 16-09-10 1949GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100916e69g001a3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
