\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil Real Closes Weaker As Government Mulls Reverse Swaps\b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 2010\par 21:41\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO (Dow Jones)--The Brazilian real closed weaker against the U.S. dollar Tuesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government mulled possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market through so-called reverse swap auctions.\par \par \uc2 The real closed at BRL1.7702 to the dollar, weaker against Monday's close of BRL1.7663.\par \par \uc2 Last week, the Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  opened informal consultations with brokerages on the possibility of resuming so-called reverse swap auctions.\par \par \uc2 Such auctions were used in 2006 and 2007 to help support the U.S. dollar against the Brazilian real at a time when the real was appreciating rapidly against the American \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A strong real hurts Brazilian exports.\par \par \uc2 The reverse swap auction is a form of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  futures market. At the auction, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps contracts indexed to interest rates for futures contracts linked to \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions.\par \par \uc2 In comments to reporters Tuesday afternoon, Finance Minister Guido Mantega said he favored use of the reverse swap mechanism, raising speculation the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may call such an auction in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also weakened Tuesday because of a weak euro and declining commodities prices. Commodities prices are a support for Brazilian export revenues.\par \par \uc2 In credit markets Tuesday, interest rate futures contracts declined on expectations for a continued benign inflation scenario. On the Brazilian Financial Exchange, interest rate futures contracts closed lower across the board. The contracts reflect investor expectations for annualized interest rates at future dates.\par \par \uc2 Among actively traded interest rate futures contracts Tuesday, that of January 2012 closed at 11.54%, down from 11.62% Monday.\par \par \uc2 -By Tom Murphy, Dow Jones Newswires; 55-11-3544-7090; brazil@dowjones.com [ 27-07-10 1941GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1156 1843   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100727e67r001h6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
