\par\par \b \uc2 Brazil stocks climb on \uc2 Petrobras\uc2 , Vale, real firms\b0\par\par\uc2 573 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 2010\par 16:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates to close)\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Jan 18 (Reuters) - Brazilian stocks closed higher on Monday as heavyweights \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  and Vale advanced, while the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed slightly.\par \par \uc2 The benchmark Bovespa stock index <.BVSP> added 0.61 percent to 69,400.93 after having dropped a cumulative 2 percent over the two previous sessions.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real <BRBY>, firmed 0.28 percent to 1.768 per U.S. dollar in thin trading due to the Martin Luther King, Jr. Day holiday markets closure in the United States.\par \par \uc2 The real weakened all last week, losing 2.4 percent against the dollar on increased bets the government would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  more in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets through \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sovereign wealth fund.\par \par \uc2 "Doubts over the actions of the sovereign wealth fund in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and the daily dollar purchases (by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) should put pressure on the real," said Miriam Tavares, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  director at brokerage AGK.\par \par \uc2 Leading gains in the Bovespa were the two most heavily-weighted stocks, \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  and Vale.\par \par \uc2 State-controlled energy giant \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  put on 2.24 percent to 36.55 reais. The company plans to sell 2 million barrels of crude oil to clients in Asia every two months, using storage tanks it owns on Japan's Okinawa island, trade sources said. For more see [ID:nSGE60H0G5].\par \par \uc2 Vale , the world's largest producer of iron ore, gained 1.21 percent to 46.70 reais.\par \par \uc2 Itau Unibanco\uc2  and Bradesco, Brazil's two largest private-sector banks, rose on expectations that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data due this week will show a decline in default rates and an increase in bank lending in December. \uc2 Itau Unibanco\uc2  climbed 0.89 percent to 37.60 reais, while Bradesco advanced 0.89 percent to 36.40 reais.\par \par \uc2 Also posting strong gains, pulp and paper company Fibria jumped 2.82 percent to 36.50 reais per share as investors snapped up the stock after it plunged 10.5 percent over four days.\par \par \uc2 Fibria has strong exposure to the pulp cycle, "the potential paper assets divestiture could lead to faster deleveraging" and "Fibria is trading in line ... with its global pulp peers," noted a report from Itau Securities dated Monday maintaining the company at outperform.\par \par \uc2 Shares of \uc2 Brasil Telecom SA\uc2  , the operating unit of the country's largest phone group Oi, dropped 2.62 percent to 14.50 reais, adding to an 11 percent plunge the previous session. Parent Oi said last week it would halt the purchase of \uc2 Brasil Telecom\uc2  stock from minority shareholders because of larger-than-expected losses from lawsuits at the unit. [ID:nN15234953]. Oi shares slid 1.77 percent to 34.43 reais.\par \par \uc2 Changes in yields on Brazilian interest rate futures contracts <0#DIJ:> were mixed, with shorter-term contracts largely ticking higher and longer-term contracts broadly edging lower.\par \par \uc2 A weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  survey showed economists expect inflation to stay in the center of the government's target in 2010 and 2011 even as forecasts for economic growth ticked higher.\par \par \uc2 The yield on the contract due January 2011 <DIJF1> edged to 10.27 percent from 10.267 percent on Friday. The yield on the contract due January 2012 <DIJF2> dipped to 11.68 percent from 11.7 percent.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Elzio Barreto, Silvio Cascione and Luciana Lopez; Editing by Diane Craft)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-BRAZIL (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|M|U|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100118e61i0012e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
